stories[9]=["A primeira viagem de Ben", "When Ben was ten, his family visited a small island.~Quando Ben tinha dez anos, a família visitou uma ilha pequena.|They took a boat early in the morning, and the sea was calm.~Pegaram um barco de manhã cedo, e o mar estava calmo.|Ben used to be afraid of snakes, so he held his mother’s hand.~Ben tinha medo de cobras, então segurou a mão da mãe.|When they arrived, the beach was empty and the sand was warm.~Quando chegaram, a praia estava vazia e a areia, morna.|He saw two turtles under a palm tree and smiled.~Ele viu duas tartarugas debaixo de uma palmeira e sorriu.|Then he lost his new hat in the water and cried.~Depois ele perdeu o chapéu novo na água e chorou.|His father did not get angry, and they looked for it together.~O pai não ficou bravo, e eles procuraram o chapéu juntos.|Two hours later, Ben found the hat under a blue towel.~Duas horas depois, Ben achou o chapéu debaixo de uma toalha azul.|That night, he slept with the hat next to his bed.~Naquela noite, ele dormiu com o chapéu ao lado da cama.|Today, Ben still keeps it on his desk at work.~Hoje, Ben ainda o guarda na mesa do trabalho."];
